<title>TURKEY: Turkey's Garanti signs $200 mln syndicated loan.</title>
<headline>Turkey's Garanti signs $200 mln syndicated loan.</headline>
<dateline>ISTANBUL 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Turkey's Garanti Bankasi signed an agreement on Thursday for a $200 million loan, arranged by BZW Dresdner bank Luxembourg S.A, Natwest Markets, The Sanwa Bank and West LB, the bank said in a statement.</p>
<p>It said the bank raised the amount to $200 million from $150 million on high demand for participation.</p>
<p>Bankers said the loan carried interest of LIBOR plus 50 basis points and an all-in cost of 85 basis points over LIBOR</p>
</text>
